{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Our Town Hero",
    "steam_appid": 3752630,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/47248431ba65359e5027edf3e09d1731.avif?t=1755638163\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After awakening in an inn with no memory, you find yourself in a sleepy little forest town. Within minutes you are chosen by the townsfolk to help restore this beautiful little town to it's former glory. Why? An ancient vampire has awakened, and kidnapped the local townsfolk. There's no barkeep. No innkeeper. Not even a shopkeeper. What's a small town to do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/7cfed40099ad4c17e54f97893771c7e9.avif?t=1755638163\" data-has-big width=800 height=620 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/f423b3ca1f53c262dd5eb6eb468a5b12.avif?t=1755638163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season you will journey into the Vampire's Forest and rescue the kidnapped townsfolk. As you advance through the story, the seasons will change. And the town will grow around you. Harvest resources in the woods. Train your fighting skills. And restore the town to it's former glory. Because you have become, <i><strong>Our Town Hero</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/8652c46bff9990d240d817b03c30ddc0.avif?t=1755638163\" width=789 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Town Hero is a retro RPG that could be described as cozy. It's being designed to evoke a nostalgic feeling, with graphics and music that would fit on a <i>Game Boy Color</i> or <i>SNES</i>. But with modern touches and up-to-date gameplay. One of the central themes of the game is the changing seasons. Winter, Spring, Summer, and Fall will bring some new weather, decor, and life to your town. The game begins in winter, with your town mostly quiet. Times are bleak. The businesses are closed due to the kidnappings. But by the end, you will hopefully have a thriving and bustling town by years end. You will be the reason this town comes alive once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll get to know the townsfolk, see how they change through the different seasons, and how they react to you as each villager is rescued. You'll also be able to help them rebuild their businesses, and the forest is thriving with items to harvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/2e5e6d7f0eee9b4c8a6467d2ab151290.avif?t=1755638163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/5425cccd60854fa675cbace7db6ded2b.avif?t=1755638163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be able to choose your character's gender, name, along with the names of the town and kingdom you are waking up in. This will be your individual journey in this retro gaming world. Other features will be added as I continue development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/4cf203fc854c173a2d87e6bad78d392b.avif?t=1755638163\" data-has-big width=800 height=620 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/358f05affdfd23c104b3e4cb7a54dfca.avif?t=1755638163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/0d7c095e9351b70880fe0b38346d2755.avif?t=1755638163\" width=331 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Town Hero will feature a retro soundtrack. MIDI's in fact. I love music that evokes that bygone era in gaming. Especially music that reminds me of <i>GBA</i> games. The music will also vary and change for each season.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/28ec3a6e419cfaefe4656b6675136024.avif?t=1755638163\" width=704 height=1216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/dce098796acc6fefb511e951ccd14914.avif?t=1755638163\" width=449 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Male or female character option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different seasons for the town (Winter, spring, summer, fall, and... <i>classified</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIDI retro music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large maps to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many enemies to encounter each season</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest resources to help townsfolk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your town grow and evolve as you rescue it's villagers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck and Handheld Gaming PC Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud save support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad, mouse, keyboard, or touch control support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/eb24ebc0784bab5cc366673dcf707cc7.avif?t=1755638163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/1c5f812336a1e50ac45771d69cea7b6c.avif?t=1755638163\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752630/extras/d74e51487196e4d5581b4efff7805c47.avif?t=1755638163\" data-has-big width=800 height=620 /></span></p>",
